# Lab Build Guide

## Environment

- VMware Workstation Pro
- Three virtual machines
- NAT networking

## Build Sequence

1. Deploy Windows Server 2022
2. Configure Active Directory
3. Configure DNS
4. Create Organizational Units
5. Join Windows 11 workstation to the domain
6. Deploy Sysmon
7. Configure Windows auditing
8. Install Splunk Enterprise
9. Install Splunk Universal Forwarders
10. Validate centralized logging
11. Develop detections
12. Perform vulnerability assessment
13. Execute incident response exercise

## Validation

- Domain authentication successful
- Sysmon operational
- Windows Security logs collected
- PowerShell logging enabled
- Splunk receiving telemetry
